{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and vibe in this post-apocalyptic RPG set in a vacation resort gone wrong. Choose your squad from 12 eccentric misfits, and scavenge the ruins of a hypercapitalist dystopia. Can you escape a hostile planet that loathes your very existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/94b3ba5ab96530fdab1dd6cf086a2be3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=864 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crew from 12 bizarre adventurers\u2014each with unique field skills, combat abilities, and delightfully quirky personalities. There's a clown, a ninja, a neanderthal, a skeleton, a sentient Twinkie, and it only gets weirder from there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely roam the sprawling ruins of Vacation Island, a post-apocalyptic paradise with over 400 screens to explore. Gain experience not just from battles, but from discovering forgotten places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with the absurd leftovers of a decadent civilization: pool noodles, nail guns, rollerblades, x-ray glasses, and more. Each of the 200 items comes with its own stats and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a mutant menagerie: gun-toting mermaids, flesh-hungry flamingos, mushroom fairies, homicidal jello cakes\u2014and much, much worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more than combat. Disarm traps, hack ATMs, forage for food, dig tunnels, and use your party\u2019s field skills to outwit the island\u2019s many dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore by interacting with hundreds of strange landmarks. Every description and line of dialogue changes depending on who\u2019s in your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of exploring, battling, and resource management. No filler! All game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/ace126e17a9e9dc7b15e84d9d406ffa3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=1200 height=424 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Secrets of the Ancients","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Another Day in Paradise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"God Complex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Be Prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Down for the Count","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Moonshot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Happily Ever After","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Willy's Wonderland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Not Your Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb505f692f8.jpg"},{"name":"Bend Reality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909230/ad2daaa1aba4f3f13ff15b20c069ecb5