s a clown, a ninja, a neanderthal, a skeleton, a sentient Twinkie, and it only gets weirder from there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely roam the sprawling ruins of Vacation Island, a post-apocalyptic paradise with over 400 screens to explore. Gain experience not just from battles, but from discovering forgotten places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with the absurd leftovers of a decadent civilization: pool noodles, nail guns, rollerblades, x-ray glasses, and more. Each of the 200 items comes with its own stats and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a mutant menagerie: gun-toting mermaids, flesh-hungry flamingos, mushroom fairies, homicidal jello cakes\u2014and much, much worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is more than combat. Disarm traps, hack ATMs, forage for food, dig tunnels, and use your party\u2019s field skills to outwit the island\u2019s many dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore by interacting with hundreds of strange landmarks. Every description and line of dialogue changes depending on who\u2019s in your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of exploring, battling, and resource management. No filler! All game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/extras/ace126e17a9e9dc7b15e84d9d406ffa3.avif?t=1774723199\" width=1200 height=424 /></span></p>","developers":["A. Hagen"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909230/1ef6c127377879fc9be5d059839f23be0084e85b/header.jpg?t=1774723199","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3909230/372628685/7d8aaf6571bd14c6ab7a50439d975d2be3702659